/-!
# (key: bridge-host-cross) The host table of design B (hub PR #3945, all-heads fill) as a Lean cross-replica host schedule

p-hostck's whole-table theorem `DS5H.whole` (design B: the all-heads fill of round wht45/reopt) (built on p-a3's kernel checker; data generated by p-hostck from p-own's
conversion of #3945's owner map: Dugongue, staged544 T360 terminal-gap fill; 360 replicas, 3,240 calls, 408 hosted
slots per call, 1,321,920 hosted slots) through `schedOfTabOK`: a `HostSchedT 360 (Fin 408) (Fin 112)` and its
residual conditions.  With the providers' residuals (`resIc Ic = resK ct resT 360 408`, p-disp / p-wgen) it is the
hypothesis of `bridgeHostT_gcert` / `bridgeHostTW_gcert`.
